WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.080
*music*

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:07.320
Good morning Hank, it's Sunday; it's news day.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:12.880
I don't know if this is true for you, but for me, at any one time, I'm able to follow about 6 news stories.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.900
So right now, I've got the economic crisis, I've got Iraq,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.120
I've got Pakistan,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.500
and then I've got the Craigslist killer,

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.800
and then fifth: I have a pretty good handle on North Korea,

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.220
and then lastly, of course, I've been closely following the breakup of Lindsay Lohan and Samantha

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.980
I-don't-know-your-last-name-and-wish-I-didn't-know-your-first-name.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.040
So, admittedly, Hank, six news stories isn't a lot,

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.280
but I feel like a pretty well informed citizen!

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.060
But then along comes a news story like Sri Lanka

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.500
and I'm like "Oh, there's been a civil war going on?"

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:36.680
"Oh, for thirty years?"

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.180
Now Hank, I'm not here to yell at people

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.500
about not paying attention to the extremely serious situation in Sri Lanka,

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.720
because it's not your fault for

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:44.660
not paying attention to it, because it's complicated

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.780
aaand no one has ever explained it to you

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.760
while rubbing Creamy peanut butter on his face.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.100
Yes, Hank, I know how to get people

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.640
to pay attention to serious international news stories...

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.100
Peanut Butter Face!

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.460
Ok Hank, so pop quiz:

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:57.360
What religion are the people

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.440
who invented both contemporary suicide bombings

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.360
and the suicide vest?

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:03.780
That's right Hank, they're Hindus.

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:05.620
Also, some are Christian,

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:06.120
uummm,

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.540
and they're not terribly religious.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.720
I'm referring, of course, to the Tamil Tigers,

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:12.420
the seperatist group

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:14.400
currently in Sri Lanka

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.480
getting the crap bombed out of them

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.460
by the Sri Lankan government.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:20.600
I don't know why I'm applying the peanut butter only to

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.160
the places where I would shave.

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.880
So Hank, to understand the Tamil Tigers

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.160
we actually have to go back to 1956.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:29.420
Sri Lanka had just gained its independence a few years before

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:33.720
and the majority Buddhist Sinhalese ethnic group

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:35.020
decided that

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:39.180
Sinhalese should be the only language in all of Sri Lanka

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.320
and that Buddhism should be the official religion.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.980
Well Hank, I'm sure I don't need to tell you how

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:46.300
the Tamil minority felt about that happening...

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:47.420
they didn't like it!

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:49.160
So these tensions simmer for decades

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.220
and finally in 1983

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:52.260
war breaks out.

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:54.180
A group called the Tamil Tigers is fighting for

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:57.800
an independent Tamil state in the northern east of Sri Lanka

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:01.460
while the Sri Lankan government is fighting to keep the island a single country.

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:02.800
And it's a difficult thing Hank,

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:05.060
because you can't have every single ethnic group that

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.520
wants its own country having its own country.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:08.580
On the other hand,

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:13.320
the government has never treated the Tamil people equally or fairly in Sri Lanka.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.180
Over the years, the war has killed more than 80,000 people

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:18.520
and there are really no good guys in this war.

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:21.140
The Sri Lankan government is inarguably to blame

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:23.180
for the disappearance of many Tamils.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:26.140
And the Tamil Tigers, aside from being a terrorist organisation

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:28.280
according to a long list of countries,

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.960
are also famous not only for their suicide bombings

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.900
but also for their recruitment of child soldiers.

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:37.860
In 2002, after almost 20 years of this on-again-off-again civil war,

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:41.500
the Sri Lankan government and the Tamil Tigers finally signed a ceasefire.

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.600
And everyone was so relieved

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:43.400
and so excited

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:44.920
and there was some thought that, eventually, like,

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:48.200
the Tamil majority part of Sri Lanka might have some measure of autonomy,

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.740
but then in the beginning of this year the war erupted again

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:52.860
and now the Tamil Tigers are on the run

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.340
and they control very little territory

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.220
and the Sri Lankan government has them surrounded

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:59.560
and is basically just trying to pound them into submission.

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:01.500
But as is the nature of rebel groups,

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:02.980
particularly, like, ones that are

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:04.860
suicidally bent on independence,

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:07.120
there is not really any "winning".

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.840
But, Hank, the worst part of the story is that

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.000
in the last 3 months

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.100
the UN estimates that more than 6,000 civilians

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.580
have been killed, either by the government or by the Tamil Tigers.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:18.420
And, Hank, when there are no obvious candidates

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.640
for the Evil Baby Orphanage

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.700
it's really easy for the international community

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.720
just to get bored and stop watching.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.980
We like to follow news stories that make sense,

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:28.220
and when news stories ask us to think hard

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:31.140
and make difficult judgements about ambiguous situations

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.220
we tend to,

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:32.860
you know,

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:35.680
only pay attention to them when someone is slathered in peanut butter

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:38.360
which, by the way, if you are wondering, is really uncomfortable.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.360
My face wants to sweat but it can't.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.980
So Hank, that's my Peanut Butter Face introduction

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:44.340
to the civil war currently raging in Sri Lanka.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:45.720
Let's hope for an immediate ceasefire

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.360
so we can have these insanely complicated political discussions

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.780
without killing thousands of people...

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:53.000
Just these few seconds! Just a- oohhh.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.540
Hank, when Willy sleeps,

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:57.760
he dreams of a world in which all people have Peanut Butter Face.

